  "steps": [
    "Cut tortilla wraps into triangles, bake or toast until crisp and golden — this is your fatteh base.",
    "Cook the ground beef with the diced onion, paprika, salt and pepper until browned and cooked through.",
    "Whisk the Greek yogurt with tahini, crushed garlic, and lemon juice until smooth to make the sauce.",
    "Layer the crisp tortilla pieces in a serving dish, spoon the cooked beef over the top.",
    "Pour the yogurt-tahini sauce generously over the beef and bread.",
    "Garnish with pomegranate seeds, toasted pine nuts, and chopped parsley. Serve immediately so the bread stays crisp."
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Assemble just before serving — the tortilla base loses its crunch if it sits too long under the sauce."
